  "solution": "HELMET → IFMNFU\n\nEach letter is shifted +1 forward in the alphabet:\n\nH → I\n\nE → F\n\nL → M\n\nM → N\n\nE → F\n\nT → U\n\n👉 Rule: +1 shift\n\nNow apply the same rule to IFMNFU:\n\nI → J\n\nF → G\n\nM → N\n\nN → O\n\nF → G\n\nU → V\n\nHence, the correct answer is JGNOGV.",
